## Notes

Most MythTV service endpoints are available under URLs like:

```text
http://BACKEND:6544/Myth/GetHostName
http://BACKEND:6544/Dvr/GetRecordedList
http://BACKEND:6544/Guide/GetProgramGuide
http://BACKEND:6544/Channel/GetChannelInfoList
http://BACKEND:6544/Content/GetRecording
```

This library automatically appends:

```text
format=json
```

to non-binary API requests.

For binary endpoints such as recordings, preview images, channel icons, and files, use `get_raw()` or the helper methods under `myth.content`.
